#. type: Plain text
#: minicom.1:374
msgid ""
"Which program to use as the script interpreter. Defaults to the program "
"\"runscript\", but if you want to use something else (eg, /bin/sh or "
"\"expect\") it is possible.  Stdin and stdout are connected to the modem, "
